    (Wslot:ℝ→ℂ)(aslot bslot Mcap Lslot εremove lo hi κ:ℝ)
    (a b Mslot εmask:ℝ)(hMslot:0≤ Mslot)(hεmask:0<εmask)(haPlain:0< a)(hbPlain:0≤ b)
