    (hκsmall:(1/6:ℝ)≤κ)(hbeta:(1/50:ℝ)≤κ)
    (hκ:2*HeckeZeroSupremum.beta-1≤κ)
    (N:ℕ)(lower upper a0 θsource:ℝ)(hlower:0< lower)(hupper:1≤ upper)
